    <h2 style="margin:0; color:#005f40; font-family:'Times New Roman', serif; text-transform:uppercase; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800;">Saidpur Residential Model School</h2>
    <p id="printTitle" style="margin:5px 0; font-weight:bold; font-size:13px; color:#475569; font-family:sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"></p>
